  "body": "The import of `pprint` from `utils` was (correctly) removed from the main `__init__.py` by b393c1fba7bfc0220637399bd3452d179e808cbd, but `pprint` was never removed from the `__all__` list.\r\n\r\nThis breaks wildcard imports. Easily reproducible since the latest `4.0.0` PyPi release:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/530c1f25-f676-407b-bfe5-5a092b73ceed)\r\n",
